<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: GOLF-LEADERS IN RAIN-INTERRUPTED MEMORIAL TOURNAMENT.</title>
<headline>GOLF-LEADERS IN RAIN-INTERRUPTED MEMORIAL TOURNAMENT.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN, Ohio 1997-06-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leaders when third-round</p>
<p>play was suspended Sunday at the rain-shortened Memorial</p>
<p>Tournament (If third round can not be completed on Monday,</p>
<p>second-round leader Scott Hoch will be declared the winner.</p>
<p>Players U.S. unless noted):</p>
<p>  1. Scott Hoch			  -12 (through 10 holes)</p>
